OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground to close for 3 years
OL,4,Afor housing build
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's playground is set to close
OL,7,Ffor about three years for the
OL,8,Fconstruction of 139 flats.
OL,10,FThe Jersey Development Company said
OL,11,FSouth Hill playground, next to the
OL,12,Fformer States of Jersey planning
OL,13,Foffices site in St Helier, would close
OL,14,Ffrom Monday 7 September and reopen in
OL,15,Fsummer 2029.
OL,17,FIt said the closure would allow the
OL,18,FWestward residential development to be
OL,19,Fbuilt, which includes plans for 35
OL,20,Fhomes for first-time buyers through a
OL,21,Fshared equity scheme.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
