OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground to close for 3 years
OL,4,Afor housing build
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said although the
OL,7,Fplayground would close, the "long-term
OL,8,Fresult will be a significantly improved
OL,9,Ffacility for the community" as it would
OL,10,Freplace the existing facilities with a
OL,11,Flarger, more modern and inclusive play
OL,12,Farea.
